OL,3,GNEWSA'First' UK women's amputee
OL,4,Afootball matches take place
OL,5,
OL,6,FA women's amputee football team formed
OL,7,Fjust months ago is set to take on the
OL,8,FPolish national team in the first
OL,9,Fall-women matches of their kind in the
OL,10,FUK.
OL,12,FCambridge City FC Women's Amputee Team
OL,13,Fwill face off against Polish opponents
OL,14,Fin two on Saturday and Sunday at the
OL,15,Fclub's FWD-IP Community Stadium in
OL,16,FSawston.
OL,18,FThere are no amputee football leagues
OL,19,Ffor women in the UK so matches and
OL,20,Ftraining are usually mixed.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
