OL,3,GNEWSA'First' UK women's amputee
OL,4,Afootball matches take place
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeam captain and ex-Amputee Lioness,
OL,7,FIzzy Papandronicou, 29, said although
OL,8,Fthe Polish team finished third in the
OL,9,FWomen's Amputee Football World Cup in
OL,10,F2024, "we can definitely face them".
